        en: `200 hectares around the historic Croxteth Hall, the city's largest single green space, with off-leash woodland trails and a working farm.`,
        es: `200 hectáreas alrededor de la histórica Croxteth Hall: el mayor espacio verde individual de a cidade, con senderos boscosos sin trela y una granja em funcionamiento.`,
