        en: `Colourful 18th-century wooden quarter, cobbled lanes, bohemian cafés (Baklandet Skydsstation), Nidelva river views. Dog-friendly throughout.`,
        es: `Colorido barrio de madera del siglo XVIII, callejones adoquinados, cafés bohemios (Baklandet Skydsstation), vistas al Nidelva. Dog-friendly em todas partes.`,
